Health Command 
 adds a simple /health command to Minecraft 



 Syntax:

 /health add &lt;targets&gt; &lt;amount&gt; 
 /health set &lt;targets&gt; &lt;amount&gt; 
 /health get &lt;targets&gt; 
 /health reset &lt;targets&gt; 



 Description:

 the health of the entity will be set to the given amount 
